            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<p>Data protected at every stage of processing and transmission</p><ul><li>✅ At Rest: AES-256All stored data encrypted with industry-standard AES-256. Keys rotated quarterly.</li><li>✅ In Transit: TLS 1.3 - All network communication uses TLS 1.3 with forward secrecy. No deprecated protocols.</li><li>✅ Edge Devices: Hardware Security - Tamper-resistant edge units with encrypted storage and secure boot.</li></ul>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
