            "title": "Vulnerability Management",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<p>Continuous monitoring and patch management</p><ul><li>✅ Daily vulnerability scans of infrastructure and application code. Critical patches within 24 hours.</li><li>✅ Annual third-party penetration testing of infrastructure and application layer.</li><li>✅ Security researchers can report vulnerabilities via security@flow-solutions.com. Coordinated disclosure process.</li></ul>",
